{"des":"雪原中的阴影-文艺系学生阿莱琳娜互动","script":"s_5_5_6","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]终于……老爸的欠款总算和哈萨琳之手撇清关系了……[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]非常感谢你们愿意伸出援手，我和父亲会永远铭记你们的恩情。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0.4,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]也请大叔别再这么冲动，找坏人借钱了。什么研究都没有自己和家人的安全重要。[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]嗯，我以后再也不会连累家人了。感谢几位的教诲……也感谢你们愿意出手帮助我们父女。[l][cm]","charaName":"阿莱琳娜的父亲"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]斯坎达那家伙才是最大的功臣呢。是他最先发现了阿莱琳娜的异状，请我们来帮忙的。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不会、不会！出手干仗的还是三位……除了垫付一点钱，我也没什么作用了……[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]斯坎达，非常感谢你……[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]没……没什么啦！能帮到阿莱琳娜同学，是……是我的荣幸才对……嘿嘿。[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]而且你还帮我们想办法把钱还上了……该感到荣幸的应该是我们才对……[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]请放心吧，这个钱我们一定会加倍努力还给大书院的。不过光感谢你可还不够，毕竟你还帮我们省去了利息，还请了三位契约者帮忙……[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这样吧，我每天来给你送便当吧。你们系平时课业那么紧，我经常看见你为了赶时间只能吃煎饼……这样你就不必操心午饭的事情了！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]啊？！这……这个……不不不不必了！像我这种胆小懦弱自闭丑陋角布林一样只配生活在下水道的人，没有资格吃阿莱琳娜同学做的饭……[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我觉得角布林也没你这么卑微吧……[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_15"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]小伙子，要有自信啊，不管你怎样看低自己，阿莱琳娜都是很欣赏你的！[l][cm]","charaName":"阿莱琳娜的父亲"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_16"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]老、老爸？！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_17"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你们很小的时候，感情不是十分要好吗。她小时候说要嫁给你的那些话，我至今可记得清清楚楚呢！[l][cm]","charaName":"阿莱琳娜的父亲"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_18"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]老——老爸！别乱说了啊！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_19"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我没有乱说啊，不是你每天回家都和我说斯坎达的事吗？还有你这身妆，不也是看到他总是喜欢看那些魔爪湖时装杂志，才这么学起来的吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"阿莱琳娜的父亲"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_20"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]——笨蛋老爸！别说了啦！大家都在这里呢！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_21"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这有什么不好说的……你那点小心思谁看不穿呢！要我说，你也应该直接一点，把你想说的话都说出来——[l][cm]","charaName":"阿莱琳娜的父亲"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_22"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]好、好啦好啦好啦！这个话题就打住吧！老爸你被那群佣兵折腾了这么久，该回去好好休息了！斯坎达，从今天开始我会一直给你送饭的，别忘了哦！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_23"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]好……好的……[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_24"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]还有老爸刚刚说的话……都是他胡言乱语，你别往心里去，也不要到处和别人乱说哦。明、明白吗……？[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_25"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]明白明白！我……我绝对不会往外说的……[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_26"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]嗯嗯……这还差不多！我们该去干活还债了，老爸！斯坎达，三位契约者，再见啦！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_27"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哦哦，再见啦！如果以后又遇到那群坏家伙找茬的话，一定要来找我们帮忙哦！[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_28"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]非常感谢几位！[l][cm]","charaName":"阿莱琳娜的父亲"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_29"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]（两人离开以后……）[l][cm]","charaName":""}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_30"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]对了对了，这是三位的报酬，非常感谢你们帮忙……[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_31"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]小意思啦，没想到出趟任务还能吃到这么甜的喜糖呢～[l]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_32"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_33","text":"你今后打算怎么做？"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_33"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]我今后一定会好好和阿莱琳娜相处，争取有朝一日……向她表白！[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_34"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]别光顾着表白啦，干脆直接结婚吧。等到那时可别忘了邀请我们啊。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_35"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]结……结结结婚？！那那那那还太早了吧！像下水道角布林一样的我怎么可能和阿莱琳娜结结结结结婚……[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_36"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不过……不过既然是诸位英雄的请求，要是我、我真有那时……一定会、会邀请大家的！！[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_37"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1b","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1b","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]就这么说好啦！一言为定哦！加油！[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_38"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1b","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}]}